                "q": "If A = {−1, −2, −3}, B = {−1, −4, −5, −6} and C = {0, −1, −2, −3, −4} then verify the following:\n1. A ∪ B = B ∪ A   2. B − C ≠ C − B\n3. A ∪ C = C ∪ A   4. (A ∪ B) ∪ C = (B ∪ C) ∪ A\n5. (A ∪ C) ∪ B = (C ∪ B) ∪ A   6. A ∩ B = B ∩ A\n7. B ∩ C = C ∩ B   8. A − C ≠ C − A\n9. (A ∩ B) ∩ C = (B ∩ C) ∩ A   10. (A ∩ C) ∩ B = (A ∩ B) ∩ C"
