                    "a": "[[T]]Feature|Physical change|Chemical change;;What changes|Only the physical appearance or state (size, shape, texture, volume, temperature)|The chemical composition — a new substance is formed;;New substance|No new substance is formed|One or more new substances are formed;;Reversible|Temporary and reversible|Permanent and irreversible;;Examples|Breaking of a glass bottle, cutting of paper, melting of ice, boiling of water|Burning of paper or wood, rusting of iron, cooking of food, photosynthesis[[/T]]",
