                    "a": "(d) Temperature — temperature is the degree of hotness or coldness of any object.",
                    "q": "[Match the statement of column 'A' with column 'B'. [[T]]Column A|Column B;;(i) Degree of hotness and coldness of any object|(a) White colour;;(ii) Best conductor of heat|(b) Copper;;(iii) Wind driven currents|(c) Radiation;;(iv) Transfer of heat in vacuum|(d) Temperature;;(v) Poor radiator of heat|(e) Ocean currents[[/T]] (i) Degree of hotness and coldness of any object"
